      "CrPC": "The Code of Criminal Procedure (1973), now updated as the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita (BNSS), which outlines the step-by-step machinery for police investigation, arrest, inquest, and trial.",
      "Dying Declaration": "A statement made by a person on their deathbed explaining the cause or circumstances of the lethal injuries that resulted in their death, admissible under Section 32(1) of the Indian Evidence Act.",
